  13:src/system_stm32f4xx.c **** /* This variable is updated in three ways:
  14:src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****     1) by calling CMSIS function SystemCoreClockUpdate()
  15:src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****     2) by calling HAL API function HAL_RCC_GetHCLKFreq()
  16:src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****     3) each time HAL_RCC_ClockConfig() is called to configure the system clock frequency
  17:src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****        Note: If you use this function to configure the system clock; then there
  18:src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****              is no need to call the 2 first functions listed above, since SystemCoreClock
  19:src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****              variable is updated automatically.
  20:src/system_stm32f4xx.c **** */
